WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
So let's talk about the skills you need to get and keep a job.

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.300
If you want to impress your boss, you'll need three types of skills.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.000
First, you'll need some kind of talent.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.800
La la la la la la.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.500
You develop your talent or skills through education,

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.500
training, and experience.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.200
Then there are employability skills.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.200
These include communication, problem solving, positive attitude,

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.600
adaptability, the ability to work with others.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.600
These are key to getting and keeping a job you love.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.500
Can you multitask, plan large projects, work well with others?

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.000
You know you can.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Finally, there's enterprise and skills.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.200
These are not only important to entrepreneurs.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.300
Everyone can benefit from having enterprise and skills.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.400
The ability to be creative, take initiative,

00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:00.100
try new things, lead a team, learn from mistakes, and find new solutions.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.200
With your talent and skills, you'll enter the job market.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.000
Here, you'll also need to understand the forces of supply and demand.
